;; effect-tags-past-128 -- every effect gets its own prompt tag.
;;
;; emit_cps_ir.c's effect_tag memoized tags in a 128-entry table and
;; handed tag 2 -- the first effect's -- to every effect after it, so
;; dk_perform (which matches a handler by tag alone) ran D129's handler
;; for a D0 perform.  `probe` must answer 1, not 999.
;; See docs/archive/effect-tags-collide-past-128-effects.md.

